                "message": "✨ Preload the citar bibliography while Emacs is idle\n\nRead the .bib files of citar one at a time in idle timers after startup,\nso the first citar call no longer parses them. Refresh a file when it is\nsaved, and keep the parsed entries on disk between sessions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCyfpEM7dFcJmFXN4v",
